			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="43" y="270" width="477" height="170" uuid="a31ba0e1-1eb6-4418-9d29-eedcbc0e15e8"/>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified"/>
				<text><![CDATA[Dear

IV INVEXDIJIN SAS is responsible for managing, through its application, the consultation of Colombian government websites, processing them to establish whether a citizen is alive or deceased, or if they are serving a sentence. It also provides a range of possible residency or location of the person in recent years. It is important to clarify that I V INVEXDIJIN SAS does not charge a price for the delivery of free information hosted on the Web, but for its capacity to collect, manage, and organize it into various documentary p roducts. This product does not contain highly personal, privileged, confidential, or sensitive information, and it complies with the general provisions of Law 1581 of 2012.]]></text>
			</staticText>
